{"seq":3,"slug":"reranking-filtering","title":"重排与过滤","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/code-retrieval-indexing/retrieval/reranking-filtering","wordCount":1357,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"重排与过滤\">重排与过滤</h1><p>混合检索融合出五十个候选块，但模型窗口只装得下八个。这最后一步——从五十里挑出真正该进窗口的八个——往往比前面所有环节加起来更能决定检索质量。前面的粗排为了保召回，宁可多捞；重排为了提精度，必须精挑。这篇讲两件事：用 cross-encoder 逐对精算相关度，以及用元数据过滤掉结构上就不该出现的块。它处理的是 <a href=\"lexical-hybrid\">词法与混合检索</a> 融合后的候选列表。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>理解重排，关键是分清两类相关度模型。粗排用的是<strong>双编码器（bi-encoder）</strong>：query 和每个块各自独立编码成向量，再算相似度——它快，因为块向量可以离线预算好（这正是 <a href=\"../indexing/code-embeddings\">代码嵌入</a> 做的事），但精度有限，因为 query 和块从不「见面」。重排用的是<strong>交叉编码器（cross-encoder）</strong>：把 query 和某个候选块拼成一个序列一起喂进模型，让它们在每一层注意力里充分交互，输出一个相关度分数——它准得多，但慢，因为每个 (query, 块) 对都要跑一次模型，无法离线预算。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>query 与块何时交互</th>\n<th>速度</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>用在哪一步</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>双编码器（bi-encoder）</td>\n<td>不交互，各自编码</td>\n<td>快，可离线</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>粗排/召回</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交叉编码器（cross-encoder）</td>\n<td>拼一起充分交互</td>\n<td>慢，须在线</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>精排/重排</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这就是「召回用 bi-encoder、精排用 cross-encoder」这一经典两段式的由来（<a href=\"https://medium.com/@akanshak/the-critical-role-of-rerankers-in-rag-98309f52abe5\">akanshak medium</a>）：用便宜的双编码器从全库捞回几十个候选，再用昂贵的交叉编码器只对这几十个精算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cross-encoder-重排怎么算\">cross-encoder 重排怎么算</h2><p>重排器接收 query <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 和候选集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = \\{c_1, \\dots, c_N\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，对每个候选独立打一个相关度分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>CrossEncoder</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_i = \\text{CrossEncoder}(q, c_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CrossEncoder</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>然后按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 降序取前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个进窗口。代价是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 次模型前向，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 不能太大——这正是为什么前面要先用粗排把全库收敛到几十个候选，再交给重排。2026 年常见的重排选项有 Cohere Rerank 这类 API 服务、以及 FlashRank、RankLLM 等开源方案（<a href=\"https://medium.com/@akanshak/the-critical-role-of-rerankers-in-rag-98309f52abe5\">akanshak medium</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[融合候选 N≈50] --&gt; B[元数据预过滤]&#10;    B --&gt; C[cross-encoder 逐对打分]&#10;    C --&gt; D[按相关度降序]&#10;    D --&gt; E[去重/去近邻冗余]&#10;    E --&gt; F[截断到窗口预算 k≈8]&#10;    F --&gt; G[喂给模型]\">flowchart TD\n    A[融合候选 N≈50] --&gt; B[元数据预过滤]\n    B --&gt; C[cross-encoder 逐对打分]\n    C --&gt; D[按相关度降序]\n    D --&gt; E[去重/去近邻冗余]\n    E --&gt; F[截断到窗口预算 k≈8]\n    F --&gt; G[喂给模型]</pre><p>注意流程图里重排前先做了元数据预过滤——把不可能相关的候选先剔掉，能省下宝贵的 cross-encoder 算力，下一节细说。</p>\n<p>延迟账也因此可算：设粗排单位成本记作 1，cross-encoder 每对成本记作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>≫</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c \\gg 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>），候选数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>处理规模</th>\n<th>相对成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>双路粗排</td>\n<td>全库</td>\n<td>与库大小相关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RRF 融合</td>\n<td>两路 top-N</td>\n<td>近似 0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>cross-encoder</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个候选</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\cdot c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>截断喂模型</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个块</td>\n<td>——</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>由于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 远大于 1，总成本几乎由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 决定。这就是为什么「先用粗排把全库收敛到几十个候选」不是可选项——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 每翻一倍，重排成本就翻一倍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"元数据过滤-结构性剪枝\">元数据过滤：结构性剪枝</h2><p>重排解决「语义上谁更相关」，过滤解决「结构上谁根本不该出现」。两者正交，配合使用。代码检索里最有用的几类元数据过滤（这些元数据来自 <a href=\"../indexing/index-structures\">索引结构</a> 的文档存储层）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>路径/目录范围</strong>：任务明确在某个模块内时，把检索限制在该目录，直接排除无关子系统。</li>\n<li><strong>语言过滤</strong>：多语言库里，修 Python bug 时把 JS 块过滤掉。</li>\n<li><strong>新鲜度过滤</strong>：剔除已被删除或已过期的块，避免检出陈旧实现——这与 <a href=\"../practice/freshness-incremental\">新鲜度与增量更新</a> 直接相关。</li>\n<li><strong>去重与去近邻冗余</strong>：同一函数的多个高度相似块、或测试与实现的重复片段，保留信息量最高的一个，把窗口预算让给不同的信息。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>过滤既是质量手段也是成本手段：预过滤减少了 cross-encoder 要打分的候选数，去冗余则让进窗口的每一块都贡献不同信息，最大化信噪比（见 <a href=\"../foundations/retrieval-vs-context\">检索与上下文窗口</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"何时该上重排-何时省掉\">何时该上重排、何时省掉</h2><p>重排不是免费的——它增加延迟和成本。是否值得，取决于场景。</p>\n<p>当查询语义模糊、候选间区分度低、且对精度要求高（比如自动修 bug，错块会让 agent 写错代码）时，重排的收益最大。反过来，如果走的是 agentic search 路线——agent 自己 grep、读文件、多轮探索（见 <a href=\"../foundations/why-code-retrieval\">为什么需要代码检索</a>）——那么「重排」某种程度上被 agent 的迭代判断取代了：它读完一个文件发现不对，自己会去找下一个，相当于人工在做精排。所以重排器最适合「一次性检索」这一路，给 agent 喂一份高精度的初始上下文；而在纯 agentic 探索里它的边际价值会下降。这条权衡会在 <a href=\"../practice/rag-over-codebase\">代码库 RAG</a> 的架构选型里再次出现，也是 <a href=\"../practice/pitfalls\">陷阱与评估</a> 要量化的对象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>粗排用 bi-encoder（快、可离线、精度中），精排用 cross-encoder（慢、须在线、精度高），构成两段式。</li>\n<li>cross-encoder 对每个 (query, 候选) 对打分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 再取 top-k，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 须先被粗排收敛到几十个。</li>\n<li>元数据过滤（路径、语言、新鲜度、去冗余）与重排正交，既提质量又省 cross-encoder 算力。</li>\n<li>预过滤+去近邻冗余让进窗口的每块贡献不同信息，最大化信噪比。</li>\n<li>重排最适合「一次性检索」给 agent 喂高精度初始上下文；纯 agentic 探索里其边际价值下降，权衡见 <a href=\"../practice/rag-over-codebase\">代码库 RAG</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"重排与过滤","id":"重排与过滤"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"cross-encoder 重排怎么算","id":"cross-encoder-重排怎么算"},{"level":2,"text":"元数据过滤：结构性剪枝","id":"元数据过滤-结构性剪枝"},{"level":2,"text":"何时该上重排、何时省掉","id":"何时该上重排-何时省掉"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"词法与混合检索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/code-retrieval-indexing/retrieval/lexical-hybrid"},"next":{"title":"代码库 RAG","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/code-retrieval-indexing/practice/rag-over-codebase"}}